  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.24 Resident",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.24 “Resident” means a person who has a principal place of abode in any New Hampshire municipality. The term includes “residency.”\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16 (from Rev 401.10); renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.23)",
